WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.878
Kyunki asli sawaal jo

2
00:00:00.898 --> 00:00:02.224
ye evidence khada karta

3
00:00:02.244 --> 00:00:02.964
hai wo ye nahi

4
00:00:02.984 --> 00:00:03.772
hai ki "beer ne

5
00:00:03.792 --> 00:00:04.647
kya kiya" — asli

6
00:00:04.667 --> 00:00:06.167
sawaal ye hai ki

7
00:00:06.187 --> 00:00:07.097
— kya together aane

8
00:00:07.117 --> 00:00:08.341
ki humari zaroorat ne

9
00:00:08.361 --> 00:00:09.472
uga ne ki zaroorat

10
00:00:09.492 --> 00:00:10.072
paida ki?

